{
  "format": "macro",
  "aspect": "9:16",
  "frame": {
    "w": 1080,
    "h": 1920
  },
  "notes": [
    "Nine shots. No ticker, no company — the subject is a print and what it",
    "does to people.",
    "",
    "THE ROOM IS THE SPINE. Open in the room, dive to the monitor for the",
    "print, back to the desk for consensus and the statement, to the sheet",
    "for the mechanism, the monitor for what is priced, and close in the",
    "room. Nothing in this format sits on bare paper: type on nothing was",
    "how the scrapped format looked, arriving by a different route.",
    "",
    "TRANSITIONS DO NOT COVER THE FRAME. ink-wipe sweeps to 100% black,",
    "and two of those in a paper-white video reads as a different show",
    "interrupting — it also makes the transition the loudest thing in a",
    "format built on restraint. underline-swipe is a stroke, not a wall.",
    "Full coverage is reserved for a chapter boundary in the LONG, where",
    "a hard reset is the point."
  ],
  "shots": [
    {
      "id": "open",
      "plate": "room-wide",
      "host": {
        "pose": "talking-at-screen",
        "slot": "figure"
      },
      "anchor": "hook",
      "captions": false,
      "max_hold_s": 6,
      "text": [
        {
          "name": "hook",
          "src": "script.hook_text",
          "size_fh": 0.085,
          "align": "top",
          "max_lines": 3,
          "draw_on_s": 0.6
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-print",
      "plate": "screen-full",
      "anchor": "print",
      "captions": false,
      "max_hold_s": 5,
      "bind": {
        "screen": "plate.number-full"
      },
      "notes": "The dive. The print is ON the monitor, full bleed — the room's screen, not a card on paper.",
      "enter": "underline-swipe",
      "text": [
        {
          "name": "print-label",
          "src": "numbers.label.0",
          "size_fh": 0.045,
          "slot": "screen.label",
          "max_lines": 1
        },
        {
          "name": "print-figure",
          "src": "numbers.latest.0",
          "size_fh": 0.14,
          "slot": "screen.figure",
          "max_lines": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "vs-expected",
      "plate": "desk-top-down",
      "anchor": "expected",
      "max_hold_s": 5,
      "bind": {
        "pages": "plate.compare-plate"
      },
      "text": [
        {
          "name": "reported",
          "src": "compare.reported",
          "size_fh": 0.05,
          "slot": "pages.left",
          "max_lines": 1
        },
        {
          "name": "expected",
          "src": "compare.expected",
          "size_fh": 0.05,
          "slot": "pages.right",
          "max_lines": 1
        },
        {
          "name": "versus",
          "src": "compare.versus",
          "size_fh": 0.04,
          "slot": "pages.gap",
          "max_lines": 1
        },
        {
          "name": "gap-read",
          "src": "script.move_summary",
          "size_fh": 0.038,
          "align": "0.80",
          "max_lines": 3
        }
      ],
      "notes": "Printed against consensus, on the desk. Surfaces, not cards in space."
    },
    {
      "id": "the-statement",
      "plate": "desk-top-down",
      "anchor": "statement",
      "max_hold_s": 6,
      "bind": {
        "pages": "plate.page-institutional"
      },
      "text": [
        {
          "name": "statement-head",
          "src": "script.headlines.0.text",
          "size_fh": 0.05,
          "align": "0.30",
          "max_lines": 2,
          "halign": "left"
        },
        {
          "name": "the-clause",
          "src": "script.headlines.0.meaning",
          "size_fh": 0.04,
          "align": "0.60",
          "max_lines": 3,
          "halign": "left"
        }
      ],
      "marks": [
        {
          "kind": "ring",
          "target": "the-clause",
          "name": "clause-ring"
        }
      ],
      "notes": "The page is a PROP, not a page you read: page-corporate's headline slot is 825x171 on a 1080-wide canvas, which holds nineteen characters at the readability floor, and a headline is thirty to forty. So the page sits on the desk and the words that have to be READ go on paper of their own over it. Left-aligned so it reads as a quoted document, and the ring goes round the clause itself rather than round a slot the clause could not fit in."
    },
    {
      "id": "the-mechanism",
      "plate": "desk-top-down",
      "anchor": "mechanism",
      "max_hold_s": 6,
      "notes": "Rate to credit to hiring, one card per beat on the desk. Three cards in a column measure 33px type against a 67px floor — a chain of three tall cards does not fit 9:16 in space, so it is told over time. The arrow on each card but the last is what carries it forward.",
      "repeat": {
        "concept": "card-consequence-b",
        "src": "script.mechanism",
        "max": 3,
        "bind": {
          "label": "$item",
          "mark": "$mark:arrow-down"
        },
        "arrange": "sequence",
        "stagger_s": 0.9,
        "connector": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "who-it-hits",
      "plate": "at-the-sheet",
      "anchor": "consequences",
      "max_hold_s": 7,
      "repeat": {
        "concept": "card-consequence",
        "src": "script.consequences",
        "max": 4,
        "bind": {
          "label": "$item",
          "mark": "$mark:arrow-down"
        },
        "arrange": "sequence",
        "stagger_s": 0.5
      },
      "notes": "One consequence per beat, pinned on the sheet. A 2x2 grid measures 47px type, still under the floor; four in a row is worse."
    },
    {
      "id": "whats-priced",
      "plate": "screen-full",
      "enter": "underline-swipe",
      "anchor": "priced",
      "max_hold_s": 6,
      "bind": {
        "screen": "chart.price"
      },
      "marks": [
        {
          "kind": "ring",
          "target": "chart.extreme_candle",
          "name": "extreme-ring"
        }
      ],
      "notes": "What the curve already believes."
    },
    {
      "id": "so-what",
      "plate": "room-wide",
      "anchor": "conclusion",
      "captions": true,
      "max_hold_s": 5,
      "text": [
        {
          "name": "so-what",
          "src": "script.conclusion",
          "size_fh": 0.06,
          "align": "top",
          "max_lines": 4,
          "draw_on_s": 0.5
        }
      ],
      "host": {
        "pose": "talking-to-camera",
        "slot": "figure"
      },
      "notes": "The payoff, said to camera. Only THE TURN earns a bare frame."
    },
    {
      "id": "close",
      "plate": "room-wide",
      "host": {
        "pose": "sitting-with-mug",
        "slot": "figure"
      },
      "max_hold_s": 4,
      "text": [
        {
          "name": "handle",
          "src": "channel.handle",
          "size_fh": 0.045,
          "align": "0.82"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
